{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "9ecfe6f0902e6e8569f2adae6ac3b341b8427212fb764b83d5a072a5e3b90add", "ja": "魅裏怨 -撮影裏話-", "zh": "魅里怨──拍摄内幕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c862f7c17c1dd0fdc280c803da7d3e2b3d7e9a2752c14f720aacc1da86d6f8ee", "ja": "映画『魅裏怨』のDVD発売イベント当日。\r\n撮影時の思い出を語り合うアイドル達。\r\n麗花は撮影前、廃校舎で幽霊役の演技指導が\r\nあったと話すが、それはあり得ない事。その\r\n事に気付いた可奈達は青ざめるのだった。", "zh": "在电影《魅里怨》的DVD发售活动当天，\n偶像们互相谈论着拍摄时的点点滴滴。\n丽花说在拍摄前，在废校舍看到了\n幽灵角色的演技老师，但那是不可能的事。\n察觉到这件事的可奈等人，不禁脸色苍白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "2252a282c7689dffdc3478664a1e992bd3ab6d2f76daedb2a0e42bf21c8efc9d", "ja": "いよいよ『魅裏怨』のリリースイベントですね。\nなんだか緊張してきました～。", "zh": "终于到了《魅里怨》的发片活动呢，\n让人不禁紧张起来了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "83b0f6d6ac4ec2ade295c73904b84eefc41cba54e7172339a5e047215d6cc1e0", "ja": "今日は、私たちのトークパートもあるんだよね？\n撮影した時の思い出を話すんだっけ。", "zh": "今天还有我们的谈话单元对吧？\n好像是要聊聊拍摄时的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "715a08d90f991b6e43fac2f235ebe6a4412ec0013072a9e79573f240d3dc23b6", "ja": "さ、撮影したときの、思い出ですか……。\nやっぱり……こ、怖かった、かも……。", "zh": "拍、拍摄时的回忆呀……\n果然是……感、感觉很恐怖吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "5f13a9e93893a3869ae34e2f4a416103ba1cb93058dce31aa02894bd998c0c4c", "ja": "私もです！　夜だったからかな～？\n撮影に使った学校、歩くだけでも怖くて……。", "zh": "我也是！可能因为是晚上吧～？\n用来拍摄的那间学校，光是要在里面走都很恐怖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "68be852d916ebea21ba822f062d2b2fda03338e4ed3e75145bbeb6920348bb9a", "ja": "もしかすると……あの旧校舎、過去に何か\nあったんでしょうか。……いわゆる、いわくつき。", "zh": "说不定……那间旧校舍在过去曾发生某些事……\n也就是背后有什么隐情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "2e5ec8b3cc72dfe0cb194e6559e8ede996bc4f556a78f7d304d2afb1225756ff", "ja": "お、脅かさないでくださいよ～。\nうう、怖くない～♪　お化けはきっとこない～♪", "zh": "请、请别吓我啦～\n唔唔，不怕不怕～♪妖魔鬼怪一定不会来～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "65859418190483ab6c81020a9fac65178c7759408f32239e9b0ca0b87a8e2146", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……。夜だったら、\nきっとどんな学校でも、怖いはず……。", "zh": "就、就是说呀……只要是晚上，\n不管是哪间学校肯定都很恐怖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "2bb0d6d2699e4466c0e65df322257cc3b9cdc9f8d6990e93f12b09b1fdcaa2ce", "ja": "あっ、もうみんなそろってるんだね！\nおはようございま～す♪", "zh": "啊，大家都已经到了呀！\n早安～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "fb85b5a1f138fa4349fc79600386312942b0f1f886995f2d26c14f20365a0cb9", "ja": "あ、麗花さん！　映画を撮影した時の思い出って、\nありますか？　その、楽しいお話で！", "zh": "啊，丽花姊！你有什么关于拍摄电影时的回忆吗？\n呃，请说点开心的话题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "daf8ec6468caf0df1452ffb56d52a8113e3b3ebabaac993cc0b2340c633740e6", "ja": "撮影の時の、楽しい思い出？\nうーん……私はずっと楽しかったよ？", "zh": "拍摄时的开心回忆？\n嗯……我一直都很开心喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "17909746376a6e0ec3dd7a9ab3f59f3a3948b0343698a8319e1a0aa3b8447f1b", "ja": "幽霊の役、とっても楽しかったもん！\nそういうお話なら、いくらでもできちゃうかも♪", "zh": "毕竟幽灵的角色非常有趣呀！\n如果是这一类的话题，不管多久我应该都能聊下去♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "ff805ea1624c688a71d459e1f9d5569125c31e1ca7592191ad189176cee45762", "ja": "自分の役について……それなら、楽しくトーク\nできるかも！　可奈でもできそう～♪　がんばるぞ～♪", "zh": "关于自己的角色……如果是这个话题，\n或许能谈得很开心呢！就连可奈也行～♪要加油啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "27c7f1e59375a1f93b5adcc29617f33c40d39e39f98d89beeb8133dd78b64078", "ja": "ふふっ、よかったぁ♪　実は私の演技はね、\nスタッフさんに教えてもらったんだよ！", "zh": "呵呵，那太好了♪\n其实我的演技呀，是工作人员教我的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "ef108cb252f8eec8c65f1984cfc10f33e1fde731b3b4f0351f90862f2f58e022", "ja": "廃校で撮影するって聞いて、楽しみになっちゃって！\n前の日の夜に、学校に探検しに行ったんだ♪", "zh": "我听说要在废弃学校拍摄后就非常期待！\n所以在前一天晚上，先跑去学校探险了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "6788a7eab17370dbf51037bd1cde99174e6466335de5da2b63d27fc9e567f048", "ja": "よ、夜に……ひとりで、ですか……？", "zh": "在、在晚上……独自一人去吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "f1ba1bbc8e5f4049e1645a81ae1bf924d1744ed4449394b36e7761dc9f86ebd9", "ja": "どこから入ろうかな～って学校の周囲を歩いてたら、\n白い服を着た女の人が、廊下を歩いてて……。", "zh": "就在我绕着学校移动，想着该从哪里进去时，\n看到有位穿着白衣的女性走在走廊上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "22358f0dd0d14f6289f372eb9053e39b58d7728c205aef95424897ad80175952", "ja": "「あっ、スタッフさんだ！」って思って手を振ったの。\nそうしたら、こう、ニッコリ笑ってくれて。", "zh": "我心想「啊，是工作人员！」于是向她挥了手。\n结果她像这样微微对我笑了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "734df7cbffbfc4b35e4439bcea72af84390d901969da8bb70621ed5cd32bcf45", "ja": "それから、すぐまた廊下をこう……\nゆらーん、ゆらーん、って歩きはじめて。", "zh": "接着她又马上在走廊上像这样……\n晃呀晃地开始向前走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "6aff93fd77a6b048dd4c9e4bd0456356e35c4dc73e71ae53db159bbf4a9a37e4", "ja": "それ、って……。", "zh": "那、是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "632b496f1fb0d185576c678f80c6e8b9a41f5bd0e882a12396c62f92f90e2c6a", "ja": "それで私もやっと気づいたの。\nあれは幽霊役の、演技指導だって！", "zh": "然后我终于注意到了，\n原来那是幽灵角色的演技老师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "1ff25815ab488aed0ab4e8b1033c29f669d545a503c2fe228f5be55573f7d538", "ja": "だから私もそれ見ながら、ゆらーん、ゆらーんって\n歩く練習をして……。", "zh": "所以我也一边看着她的动作，\n一边晃呀晃地练习走路……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "cff08825d2967ddc9247143a9331cdf82998a0eaeecb369b31a51c63b5504836", "ja": "あの学校……撮影初日に監督が鍵開けるまで、\n誰も入れないはずですよ……ね？", "zh": "那间学校……在导演于拍摄第一天打开门锁前，\n应该没有人进得去才对……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "8d32e623b31902bf6298f2c93ab01e0a181a7fb50b80f8fe355477b5238e1427", "ja": "ま、真っ暗なのに……、ど、どうして女の人が……\n見えたんですか……？", "zh": "明、明明一片漆黑……\n为、为什么看得见……那位女性呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "1581e50ce8ee12cc009faf4eebfdb61927a147fc377c348aa5aaccfe1a7a94cb", "ja": "あれ？　そういえば、なんでだろう？", "zh": "奇怪？这么说来是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "27e12e34eb7b5a48b2ae4161b647391991651f458a698abde52eca56f8251abb", "ja": "謎はすべて解けました。今、検索してみたところ、\nあの学校の場所には昔、病院が建っていたらしく……。", "zh": "谜题全都解开了，我刚才搜寻之后，\n发现那间学校的所在地，以前似乎是一座医院……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "4abf9ae6ce93c56c479f01ff9a433a3896ae8fc3916008f2adde2dfe91130fb1", "ja": "す、ストーップ！！　\nほら！　そろそろ時間だから！", "zh": "别、别说了──！！\n你们看！时间差不多快到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "3628c996293b912f3058b20f54bb144b4643eb81489fb2f5f826f1b002636100", "ja": "気を取り直して、みんな！　だ、大丈夫っ！\n別にその女の人が会場にいるわけじゃないんだし……。", "zh": "重新振作一下吧，各位！没、没事的！\n反正那位女性又不在会场里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "b26d68b1d9c7e9f1f48296ffcf3e434bb3cb43d3bc14763f69c8d80233c3e755", "ja": "え？　いるよ？", "zh": "咦？她在呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "79caefc1a0d1d277f92ac42f1dda0ae023875361d68d22dde9c14e48b24ffe1d", "ja": "ほら見て？　あそこに……、\nお客さんたちの後ろに……ほら！", "zh": "你们看，就在那里……\n在客人们的后面……对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "0324c5cb1f288e5080e8e486c49ef3cd964f9405a1a3b9920a9ecb1a88fe6180", "ja": "キャーッ！！", "zh": "呀──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "0324c5cb1f288e5080e8e486c49ef3cd964f9405a1a3b9920a9ecb1a88fe6180", "ja": "キャーッ！！", "zh": "呀──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "0324c5cb1f288e5080e8e486c49ef3cd964f9405a1a3b9920a9ecb1a88fe6180", "ja": "キャーッ！！", "zh": "呀──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_07_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "0324c5cb1f288e5080e8e486c49ef3cd964f9405a1a3b9920a9ecb1a88fe6180", "ja": "キャーッ！！", "zh": "呀──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
